As per order no.345-A dated 23.10.2025, 30.10.2025 when this Court came to know from the reports submitted relating to sanitation arrangement in CMC that more than three crores are paid to the three agencies every month towards the contract amount for sanitation activities including desilting of drains and Registrar (Judicial) vs State Of Odisha & Others .... Opp. ... on 30 October, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/187702225/
1 garbage disposal, looking at the appalling state of sanitation in Cuttack City, we asked the Deputy Commissioner (Sanitation) to remain present in person and he was directed to clarify on the following counts:-
a) Daily report submitted by mates from 01.09.2025 to 30.09.2025;

b) The report of the ward supervisors of all the three agencies from 01.09.2025 to 30.09.2025;
c) The evaluation report of the sanitation section on sanitation activities based on the MIS evaluation;
d) Penalty amount imposed on the sanitation agencies for the period from 01.01.2025 to 30.09.2025.
